-module__fOjjCW__cell"><p>India</p></div></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><div class="align--center padding--top--m"><button type="button" class="text-cbi-blue w-full border-t border-[#E0E0E0] py-4 font-medium hover:underline" data-test="open-cta-modal-btn">Learn more by requesting a demo</button></div></div></div></div></div><div class="col-span-3"><div class="max-lg:hidden flex flex-row max-lg:flex-1 lg:flex-col"><div class="bg-[#000C20] max-lg:flex-[50%]"><span class="hs-cta-wrapper" id="hs-cta-wrapper-44dc5cae-a986-48aa-996a-34cb6eef5c03"><span class="hs-cta-node hs-cta-44dc5cae-a986-48aa-996a-34cb6eef5c03" id="hs-cta-44dc5cae-a986-48aa-996a-34cb6eef5c03"><a href="https://cta-redirect.hubspot.com/cta/redirect/763793/44dc5cae-a986-48aa-996a-34cb6eef5c03" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><img class="hs-cta-img" id="hs-cta-img-44dc5cae-a986-48aa-996a-34cb6eef5c03" src="https://no-cache.hubspot.com/cta/default/763793/44dc5cae-a986-48aa-996a-34cb6eef5c03.png" alt="New call-to-action"/></a></span></span></div></div></div></div></div><div class="col-span-8 max-lg:col-span-11"><div class="pb-6"><div data-test="section-component" class="mx-auto mt-6 border border-[#E0E0E0] max-w-[1250px] px-6 bg-white"><section data-test="who-to-watch-section" class="padding--y--m"><h2 data-test="who-to-watch-header" class="padding--y--s margin--bottom--m text-xl font-medium text-black">Compare Frido to Competitors</h2><div class="WhoToWatch-module__dO6fma__whoToWatchGrid"><div data-test="who-to-watch-item" class="display--flex"><div data-test="shapecrunch-who-to-watch-logo" class="WhoToWatch-module__dO6fma__whoToWatchLogoWrapper"><img class="WhoToWatch-module__dO6fma__whoToWatchLogo" alt="Shapecrunch Logo" src="https://s3-us-west-2.amazonaws.com/cbi-image-service-prd/original/2080708a-10eb-4eb6-a769-f84321d36975.png"/></div><div data-test="shapecrunch-who-to-watch-content"><a href="/company/shapecrunch" data-test="who-to-watch-link" class="fontSize--default color--blue fontWeight--bold">Shapecrunch</a><p data-test="who-to-watch-description" class="WhoToWatch-module__dO6fma__description">Shapecrunch provides custom orthopedic footwear and insoles. The company offers products such as 3D printed insoles and orthopedic shoes for individuals with flat feet, heel pain, and other foot conditions. It is based in New Delhi, India.</p></div></div><div data-test="who-to-watch-item" class="display--flex"><div data-test="calla-shoes-who-to-watch-logo" class="WhoToWatch-module__dO6fma__whoToWatchLogoWrapper"><img class="WhoToWatch-module__dO6fma__whoToWatchLogo" alt="Calla Shoes Logo" src="https://s3-us-west-2.amazonaws.com/cbi-image-service-prd/original/3998d1cc-f598-4ebb-bea9-fc084005b1fc.png"/></div><div data-test="calla-shoes-who-to-watch-content"><a href="/company/calla-shoes" data-test="who-to-watch-link" class="fontSize--default color--blue fontWeight--bold">Calla Shoes</a><p data-test="who-to-watch-description" class="WhoToWatch-module__dO6fma__description">Calla Shoes offers footwear designed for women with bunions, wide feet, and other foot problems. The company provides shoes that feature wider toe boxes, arch-supported insoles, and stable heel heights. It was founded in 2016 and is based in Newton-le-Willows, England.</p></div></div><div data-test="who-to-watch-item" class="display--flex"><div data-test="tread-butter-who-to-watch-logo" class="WhoToWatch-module__dO6fma__whoToWatchLetterLogo">T</div><div data-test="tread-butter-who-to-watch-content"><a href="/company/tread-butter" data-test="who-to-watch-link" class="fontSize--default color--blue fontWeight--bold">Tread &amp; Butter</a><p data-test="who-to-watch-description" class="WhoToWatch-module__dO6fma__description">Tread &amp; Butter specializes in the design and production of cork insoles within the footwear accessories industry. Their products offer plush comfort, shock absorption, and pain reduction, catering to individuals with different arch needs. Tread &amp; Butter is committed to sustainability and provides educational resources on foot health. It was founded in 2017 and is based in Bend, Oregon.</p></div></div><div data-test="who-to-watch-item" class="display--flex"><div data-test="tread-labs-who-to-watch-logo" class="WhoToWatch-module__dO6fma__whoToWatchLetterLogo">T</div><div data-test="tread-labs-who-to-watch-content"><a href="/company/tread-labs" data-test="who-to-watch-link" class="fontSize--default color--blue fontWeight--bold">Tread Labs</a><p data-test="who-to-watch-description" class="WhoToWatch-module__dO6fma__description">Tread Labs is a company focused on improving mobility, operating in the footwear industry. The company offers semi-custom orthotic insoles and sandals designed to increase comfort and performance. Their products are primarily targeted towards individuals seeking enhanced foot support and comfort. It was founded in 2015 and is based in Woburn, Massachusetts.</p></div></div><div data-test="who-to-watch-item" class="display--flex"><div data-test="kinis-healthtech-who-to-watch-logo" class="WhoToWatch-module__dO6fma__whoToWatchLetterLogo">K</div><div data-test="kinis-healthtech-who-to-watch-content"><a href="/company/kinis-healthtech" data-test="who-to-watch-link" class="fontSize--default color--blue fontWeight--bold">Kinis HealthTech</a><p data-test="who-to-watch-description" class="WhoToWatch-module__dO6fma__description">Kinis HealthTech specializes in the design and manufacturing of minimalist footwear within the health and wellness sector. Their products are aimed at natural foot movement and foot health, with a focus on comfort and functionality. The company primarily serves individuals who use minimalist shoes. It was founded in 2017 and is based in Richmond, Virginia.</p></div></div><div data-test="who-to-watch-item" class="display--flex"><div data-test="tynor-orthotics-who-to-watch-logo" class="WhoToWatch-module__dO6fma__whoToWatchLogoWrapper"><img class="WhoToWatch-module__dO6fma__whoToWatchLogo" alt="Tynor Logo" src="https://s3-us-west-2.amazonaws.com/cbi-image-service-prd/original/5a7cf75d-3145-4e23-a766-a12ab6558861.png"/></div><div data-test="tynor-orthotics-who-to-watch-content"><a href="/company/tynor-orthotics" data-test="who-to-watch-link" class="fontSize--default color--blue fontWeight--bold">Tynor</a><p data-test="who-to-watch-description" class="WhoToWatch-module__dO6fma__description">Tynor focuses on the design and manufacture of orthotic care products within the healthcare sector. The company provides supports and braces intended to address musculoskeletal pain, assist in injury rehabilitation, and facilitate daily living activities. Tynor serves various clients, including individuals seeking support for sports activities, daily living assistance, posture correction, and support for conditions related to pregnancy and sleep. It was founded in 1993 and is based in Mohali, India.</p></div></div></div></section></div></div></div></div><p>Loading...</p></div></main><footer class="Footer-module__Grjkva__footer-container"><div class="Footer-module__Grjkva__footer-content"><div class="Footer-module__Grjkva__footer-mainContent"><section class="padding--bottom--l Footer-module__Grjkva__footer-addressSection"><div class="relative h-[20px] w-[178px]"><img alt="CB Insights" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="(min-width: 375px) 178px" srcSet="https://public-pages.cbinsights.com/public-site/667337/_next/static/public/images/CBI_Logo_White.svg?w=32&amp;q=75 32w, https://public-pages.cbinsights.com/public-site/667337/_next/static/public/images/CBI_Logo_White.svg?w=48&amp;q=75 48w, https://public-pages.cbinsights.com/public-site/667337/_next/static/public/images/CBI_Logo_White.svg?w=64&amp;q=75 64w, https://public-pages.cbinsights.com/public-site/667337/_next/static/public/images/CBI_Logo_White.svg?w=96&amp;q=75 96w, https://public-pages.cbinsights.com/public-site/667337/_next/static/public/images/CBI_Logo_White.svg?w=128&amp;q=75 128w, https://public-pages.cbinsights.com/public-site/667337/_next/static/public/images/CBI_Logo_White.svg?w=256&amp;q=75 256w, https://public-pages.cbinsights.com/public-site/667337/_next/static/public/images/CBI_Logo_White.svg?w=384&amp;q=75 384w, https://public-pages.cbinsights.com/public-site/667337/_next/static/public/images/CBI_Logo_White.svg?w=640&amp;q=75 640w, https://public-pages.cbinsights.com/public-site/667337/_next/static/public/images/CBI_Logo_White.svg?w=750&amp;q=75 750w, https://public-pages.cbinsights.com/public-site/667337/_next/static/public/images/CBI_Logo_White.svg?w=828&amp;q=75 828w, https://public-pages.cbinsights.com/public-site/667337/_next/static/public/images/CBI_Logo_White.svg?w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, https://public-pages.cbinsights.com/public-site/667337/_next/static/public/images/CBI_Logo_White.svg?w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, https://public-pages.cbinsights.com/public-site/667337/_next/static/public/images/CBI_Logo_White.svg?w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, https://public-pages.cbinsights.com/public-site/667337/_next/static/public/images/CBI_Logo_White.svg?w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, https://public-pages.cbinsights.com/public-site/667337/_next/static/public/images/CBI_Logo_White.svg?w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="https://public-pages.cbinsights.com/public-site/667337/_next/static/public/images/CBI_Logo_White.svg?w=3840&amp;q=75"/></div><address>498 Seventh Avenue 12th floor<br/>New York, NY 10018</address><address><a href="mailto:info@cbinsights.com">info@cbinsights.com</a><br/><a href="tel:+12122923148">212 292 3148</a></address><p>Follow Us On Social</p><div class="Footer-module__Grjkva__social-links"><a class="Footer-module__Grjkva__social-img" href="https://twitter.com/CBinsights" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><img alt="Twitter" loading="lazy" width="30" height="30" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" srcSet="https://public-pages.cbinsights.com/public-site/667337/_next/static/public/images/twitter-icon.svg?w=32&amp;q=75 1x, https://public-pages.cbinsights.com/public-site/667337/_next/static/public/images/twitter-icon.svg?w=64&amp;q=75 2x" src="https://public-pages.cbinsights.com/public-site/667337/_next/static/public/images/twitter-icon.svg?w=64&amp;q=75"/></a><a class="Footer-module__Grjkva__social-img" href="https://linkedin.com/company/cb-insights/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><img alt="Linkedin" loading="lazy" width="30" height="30" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" srcSet="https://public-pages.cbinsights.com/public-site/667337/_next/static/public/images/linkedin-icon.svg?w=32&amp;q=75 1x, https://public-pages.cbinsights.com/public-site/667337/_next/static/public/images/linkedin-icon.svg?w=64&amp;q=75 2x" src="https://public-pages.cbinsights.com/public-site/667337/_next/static/public/images/linkedin-icon.svg?w=64&amp;q=75"/></a><a class="Footer-module__Grjkva__social-img" href="https://facebook.com/cbinsights/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><img alt="Facebook" loading="lazy" width="30" height="30" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" srcSet="https://public-pages.cbinsights.com/public-site/667337/_next/static/public/images/fb-icon.svg?w=32&amp;q=75 1x, https://public-pages.cbinsights.com/public-site/667337/_next/static/public/images/fb-icon.svg?w=64&amp;q=75 2x" src="https://public-pages.cbinsights.com/public-site/667337/_next/static/public/images/fb-icon.svg?w=64&amp;q=75"/></a></div></section><nav class="Footer-module__Grjkva__footer-nav"><section class="Footer-module__Grjkva__footer-menuSection"><h3><a href="https://www.cbinsights.com/#">About</a></h3><ul><li><a href="https://www.cbinsights.com/about/">About Us</a></li><li><a href="https://www.cbinsights.com/research/events">Upcoming Webinars</a></li><li><a href="https://www.cbinsights.com/contact-us/">Contact Us</a></li></ul></section><section class="Footer-module__Grjkv