dicating the presence of one or more people, the lighting device is caused to operate in an occupied target environment operating mode including causing the lighting device to emit far-UVC light at a given intensity into the target environment for a first period of time; and, in response to expiry of the first period of time, causing the lighting device to emit far-UVC light at a different intensity to the given intensity into the target environment for a second period of time.\n","hasBlur":false}}],"numResults":1,"totalNumResults":1},"11":{"businessRelationships":[{"startDate":{"value":"2025-12-21","hasBlur":false},"businessPartners":{"value":[{"id":11330804,"idEntityType":1,"name":"Soorma Hockey Club","country":"","playerRole":"Partner","productName":"","idPlayer":0,"slug":"soorma-hockey-club","companyDescription":"","companyLogoUrl":"","analystSurveyAvailable":false,"idOrg":11516692,"companyHighResLogoUrl":"","orgUrl":"soormahockeyclub.com"}],"hasBlur":false},"id":{"value":1822036,"hasBlur":false},"newsSnippet":{"value":{"title":"Frido \u0026 Soorma: Pro Hockey Alliance \u0026 Rising Star 🏒","url":"https://www.archyworldys.com/frido-soorma-pro-hockey-alliance-rising-star-%f0%9f%8f%92/","content":"This partnership marks Frido 's official entry into the world of professional hockey , aligning the brand with a team poised to make waves in the revived Hockey India League ."},"hasBlur":false},"sources":{"value":1,"hasBlur":false}},{"startDate":{"value":"2025-11-04","hasBlur":false},"businessPartners":{"value":[{"id":1868675,"idEntityType":1,"name":"BuzzWorks","country":"Indonesia","playerRole":"Partner","productName":"","idPlayer":0,"slug":"","companyDescription":"BuzzWorks provides coworking and managed office spaces within the real estate sector. The company offers workspace solutions equipped with amenities, aimed at supporting productivity and community. BuzzWorks serves enterprises seeking environments. It was founded in 2012 and is based in Indonesia.","companyL