 focused on improving mobility, operating in the footwear industry. The company offers semi-custom orthotic insoles and sandals designed to increase comfort and performance. Their products are primarily targeted towards individuals seeking enhanced foot support and comfort. It was founded in 2015 and is based in Woburn, Massachusetts.","slug":"tread-labs","idEntityType":1,"hasAnalystBriefing":false},{"idCbiEntity":1114405,"idCompany":961518,"idInvestor":0,"name":"Kinis HealthTech","url":"kinis.com","logo":"","description":"Kinis HealthTech specializes in the design and manufacturing of minimalist footwear within the health and wellness sector. Their products are aimed at natural foot movement and foot health, with a focus on comfort and functionality. The company primarily serves individuals who use minimalist shoes. It was founded in 2017 and is based in Richmond, Virginia.","slug":"kinis-healthtech","idEntityType":1,"hasAnalystBriefing":false},{"idCbiEntity":197587,"idCompany":330189,"idInvestor":0,"name":"Tynor","url":"tynorstore.com","logo":"https://s3-us-west-2.amazonaws.com/cbi-image-service-prd/original/5a7cf75d-3145-4e23-a766-a12ab6558861.png","description":"Tynor focuses on the design and manufacture of orthotic care products within the healthcare sector. The company provides supports and braces intended to address musculoskeletal pain, assist in injury rehabilitation, and facilitate daily living activities. Tynor serves various clients, including individuals seeking support for sports activities, daily living assistance, posture correction, and support for conditions related to pregnancy and sleep. It was founded in 1993 and is based in Mohali, India.","slug":"tynor-orthotics","idEntityType":1,"hasAnalystBriefing":false}]},"comparable_companies":{"tynor-orthotics":"Tynor","calla-shoes":"Calla Shoes","profoot":"PROFOOT","tread-butter":"Tread \u0026 Butter","tread-labs":"Tread Labs"},"analyst_insights":{"attachments":{},"clientRelationships":[],"competitors"